    softwareDevelopers: 'Ko wai e mahi ana i te DeHub',
    softwareDevText1: 'Ko DeHub he Dao motuhake. Kaore he kamupene e whai, e whakahaere ana, e whakahaere ana ranei i te Ratonga. Ko te pūkete, te papa me te taonga e whakahaerehia ana e nga rangatira o DeHub token mā te pūkete whakahaere DeHub, e ora ana: ka whakaarahia nga tono, ka pootihia i roto i te taupānga, ka herea te hua ki te taiao. I roto i tenei Whakaaetanga "DeHub", "tatou", me "to tatou" te tikanga o te Dao me te pūkete e whakahaere ana, ehara i te kamupene.',
    softwareDevText2: 'Ko te whanaketanga e whakahaerehia ana e nga kaihauturu motuhake me nga whare wānanga e uru ana ki te DAO. Kaore tetahi o ratou e whai i te taiao DeHub, e whai mana ana ranei ki te whakatau, a, ka taea te whakakapi, te whakakore ranei i tetahi o ratou ma te pooti whakahaere. Kaore e taea e tetahi te huri i te pūkete, i te tohu, i enei Ture ranei i waho o taua tukanga.',
    whoMayUse: 'Ko wai e taea te whakamahi i te ratonga?',
    ageRequirements: 'Ngā whakaritenga tau',
    ageRequirementsText: 'Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i te Ratonga anake ki te 16 tau koe.',
    parentPermission: '**Tino mana tō ngā kaitiaki mō te tino whakaute**',
    parentPermissionText: 'Mena kei raro koe i te 18 tau, me whai whakaaetanga a to matua, o to kaitiaki ture ranei ki te whakamahi i te Ratonga. Tena koa pānuihia tenei Whakaaetanga ki a koutou.',
    businesses: 'Ngā pakihi',
    businessesText: 'Mena kei te whakamahi koe i te Ratonga i runga i te ingoa o te kamupene, o te whakahaere ranei, ka whakapumautia e koe kei a koe te mana ki te mahi i runga i te ingoa o taua umanga, ka whakaae taua umanga ki tenei Whakaaetanga.',
    walletConnections: 'Ngā hononga Wallet me te tuakiri',
    walletText1: 'Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i nga waahanga o te Ratonga, penei i te tirotiro me te kimi i nga ihirangi, me te kore e hono i tetahi putea. Heoi, e hiahia ana koe ki te putea crypto hototahi ki te whakamahi i ngā āhuatanga moni me te whai wāhi i roto i te whakahaere.',
